<title>USA: Lockheed, Northrop to merge in $11.6 billion deal.</title>
<headline>Lockheed, Northrop to merge in $11.6 billion deal.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerospace goliaths Lockheed Martin Corp. and Northrop Grumman Corp. plan to merge in a deal valued at $11.6 billion, the companies said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a joint press release, they said Northrop shareholders would receive 1.1923 shares of Lockheed for each share of Northrop.</p>
